---
interface Props {
  supabaseUrl: string;
  relayUrl?: string;
  publishableKey: string;
}

const {
  supabaseUrl,
  relayUrl = '',
  publishableKey,
} = Astro.props;
const ydbControlUrl = 'https://d5da9drpe2ndhlf7c1d5.nkhmighe.apigw.yandexcloud.net/v1/ydb-control';
---

<main
  class="connectivity"
  data-focus-connectivity
  data-supabase-url={supabaseUrl}
  data-supabase-relay-url={relayUrl}
  data-supabase-key={publishableKey}
  data-ydb-control-url={ydbControlUrl}
>
  <section class="connectivity__card">
    <p class="connectivity__eyebrow">Диагностика соединения · версия 2</p>
    <h1>Проверим доступ к функциям сайта</h1>
    <p class="connectivity__lead">
      Проверка выполняет только безопасные чтения. Она ничего не сохраняет,
      не меняет профиль и не отправляет писем.
    </p>
    <p class="connectivity__scope" role="note">
      Результат относится только к этому устройству и этой сети в момент проверки.
      Он не является сообщением о глобальном состоянии Supabase или Yandex Cloud.
    </p>
    <button class="connectivity__run" type="button" data-connectivity-run>Начать проверку</button>
    <p class="connectivity__status" data-connectivity-status role="status" aria-live="polite">
      Обычно проверка занимает несколько секунд.
    </p>

    <div class="connectivity__results" data-connectivity-results hidden>
      <section class="connectivity__group" aria-labelledby="connectivity-core-heading">
        <div class="connectivity__group-heading">
          <h2 id="connectivity-core-heading">Основные функции</h2>
          <p>Именно эти проверки отвечают на вопрос, можно ли сейчас пользоваться сайтом.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="connectivity__result-grid">
          <article class="connectivity__result" data-connectivity-result="framework-auth">
            <div>
              <h3>Вход в аккаунт</h3>
              <p>Сайт автоматически выбирает доступный маршрут.</p>
            </div>
            <strong data-connectivity-verdict>Проверяем…</strong>
            <span data-connectivity-timing></span>
          </article>
          <article class="connectivity__result" data-connectivity-result="framework-data">
            <div>
              <h3>Данные и персонализация</h3>
              <p>Безопасное чтение через реально выбранный маршрут.</p>
            </div>
            <strong data-connectivity-verdict>Проверяем…</strong>
            <span data-connectivity-timing></span>
          </article>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="connectivity__group" aria-labelledby="connectivity-routes-heading">
        <div class="connectivity__group-heading">
          <h2 id="connectivity-routes-heading">Маршруты подключения</h2>
          <p>Прямой путь и резерв через Yandex проверяются независимо.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="connectivity__result-grid">
          <article class="connectivity__result" data-connectivity-result="direct-auth">
            <div><h3>Supabase напрямую — вход</h3><p>Прямой путь без Yandex relay.</p></div>
            <strong data-connectivity-verdict>Проверяем…</strong>
            <span data-connectivity-timing></span>
          </article>
          <article class="connectivity__result" data-connectivity-result="direct-data">
            <div><h3>Supabase напрямую — данные</h3><p>Чтение данных по прямому пути.</p></div>
            <strong data-connectivity-verdict>Проверяем…</strong>
            <span data-connectivity-timing></span>
          </article>
          <article class="connectivity__result" data-connectivity-result="relay-auth">
            <div><h3>Резерв через Yandex — вход</h3><p>Отдельный путь к тому же Supabase Auth.</p></div>
            <strong data-connectivity-verdict>Проверяем…</strong>
            <span data-connectivity-timing></span>
          </article>
          <article class="connectivity__result" data-connectivity-result="relay-data">
            <div><h3>Резерв через Yandex — данные</h3><p>Отдельный путь к тем же данным Supabase.</p></div>
            <strong data-connectivity-verdict>Проверяем…</strong>
            <span data-connectivity-timing></span>
          </article>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="connectivity__group" aria-labelledby="connectivity-service-heading">
        <div class="connectivity__group-heading">
          <h2 id="connectivity-service-heading">Служебный канал</h2>
          <p>Эта проверка помогает диагностике, но не подтверждает сохранение основных действий.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="connectivity__result-grid">
          <article class="connectivity__result" data-connectivity-result="ydb-control">
            <div>
              <h3>Служебный канал YDB</h3>
              <p>Диагностика и аналитика; не является владельцем входа, профиля или обратной связи.</p>
            </div>
            <strong data-connectivity-verdict>Проверяем…</strong>
            <span data-connectivity-timing></span>
          </article>
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>

    <div class="connectivity__receipt" data-connectivity-receipt hidden>
      <section class="connectivity__verdict" data-connectivity-verdict-box>
        <p class="connectivity__verdict-title" data-connectivity-summary></p>
        <p data-connectivity-detail></p>
        <p data-connectivity-route></p>
        <p class="connectivity__guidance" data-connectivity-guidance></p>
      </section>
      <dl>
        <div><dt>Итог</dt><dd data-connectivity-code>—</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Код проверки</dt><dd data-connectivity-id>—</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Когда</dt><dd data-connectivity-when>—</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Не ответили</dt><dd data-connectivity-failed>—</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Режим</dt><dd data-connectivity-network>—</dd></div>
      </dl>
      <p class="connectivity__send">
        Отправьте скриншот целиком или скопируйте строку результата. Не повторяйте
        многократно действие, которое сайт уже подтвердил отдельно.
      </p>
      <label class="connectivity__copy">
        <span>Строка результата без email, кода входа и токенов</span>
        <input type="text" readonly data-connectivity-copy value="" />
      </label>
      <button class="connectivity__copy-button" type="button" data-connectivity-copy-button>
        Скопировать результат
      </button>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>

<script>
  import {
    diagnoseConnectivity,
    makeCompactConnectivityReceipt,
    runConnectivityProbe,
    type ConnectivityProbeResult,
  } from '../lib/connectivityDiagnostic';
  import { createResilientSupabaseTransport } from '../lib/resilientSupabaseTransport';

  const root = document.querySelector<HTMLElement>('[data-focus-connectivity]');
  const runButton = root?.querySelector<HTMLButtonElement>('[data-connectivity-run]');
  const status = root?.querySelector<HTMLElement>('[data-connectivity-status]');
  const resultsRoot = root?.querySelector<HTMLElement>('[data-connectivity-results]');
  const receiptRoot = root?.querySelector<HTMLElement>('[data-connectivity-receipt]');
  const verdictBox = root?.querySelector<HTMLElement>('[data-connectivity-verdict-box]');
  const summary = root?.querySelector<HTMLElement>('[data-connectivity-summary]');
  const detail = root?.querySelector<HTMLElement>('[data-connectivity-detail]');
  const routeSummary = root?.querySelector<HTMLElement>('[data-connectivity-route]');
  const guidance = root?.querySelector<HTMLElement>('[data-connectivity-guidance]');
  const receiptCode = root?.querySelector<HTMLElement>('[data-connectivity-code]');
  const receiptId = root?.querySelector<HTMLElement>('[data-connectivity-id]');
  const receiptWhen = root?.querySelector<HTMLElement>('[data-connectivity-when]');
  const receiptFailed = root?.querySelector<HTMLElement>('[data-connectivity-failed]');
  const receiptNetwork = root?.querySelector<HTMLElement>('[data-connectivity-network]');
  const copyField = root?.querySelector<HTMLInputElement>('[data-connectivity-copy]');
  const copyButton = root?.querySelector<HTMLButtonElement>('[data-connectivity-copy-button]');
  let coolingDown = false;

  const diagnosticId = () => {
    const bytes = new Uint8Array(4);
    crypto.getRandomValues(bytes);
    return [...bytes]
      .map((value) => value.toString(16).padStart(2, '0'))
      .join('')
      .toUpperCase()
      .replace(/^(.{4})(.{4})$/u, '$1-$2');
  };

  const routeCopy = (route: ConnectivityProbeResult['route']) => (
    route === 'direct' ? 'прямой маршрут' : route === 'relay' ? 'резерв через Yandex' : ''
  );

  const renderResult = (result: ConnectivityProbeResult) => {
    const card = root?.querySelector<HTMLElement>(`[data-connectivity-result="${result.id}"]`);
    const verdict = card?.querySelector<HTMLElement>('[data-connectivity-verdict]');
    const timing = card?.querySelector<HTMLElement>('[data-connectivity-timing]');
    if (!card || !verdict || !timing) return;
    card.dataset.state = result.state;
    const copy = {
      ok: 'Доступно',
      http_error: `Ответ с ошибкой${result.status ? ` · ${result.status}` : ''}`,
      timeout: 'Не ответил вовремя',
      network_error: 'Нет соединения',
      not_configured: 'Не настроено',
    }[result.state];
    verdict.textContent = copy;
    const route = result.id.startsWith('framework-') ? routeCopy(result.route) : '';
    const timingCopy = result.medianMs === null ? '' : `${Math.round(result.medianMs)} мс`;
    timing.textContent = [timingCopy, route].filter(Boolean).join(' · ');
  };

  const resetResults = () => {
    root?.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('[data-connectivity-result]').forEach((card) => {
      delete card.dataset.state;
      const verdict = card.querySelector<HTMLElement>('[data-connectivity-verdict]');
      const timing = card.querySelector<HTMLElement>('[data-connectivity-timing]');
      if (verdict) verdict.textContent = 'Проверяем…';
      if (timing) timing.textContent = '';
    });
  };

  const setCooldown = () => {
    coolingDown = true;
    if (runButton) {
      runButton.disabled = true;
      runButton.textContent = 'Повторить можно через 30 секунд';
    }
    window.setTimeout(() => {
      coolingDown = false;
      if (runButton) {
        runButton.disabled = false;
        runButton.textContent = 'Проверить ещё раз';
      }
    }, 30_000);
  };

  copyButton?.addEventListener('click', async () => {
    const value = copyField?.value || '';
    if (!value || !copyButton) return;
    try {
      if (navigator.clipboard?.writeText) {
        await navigator.clipboard.writeText(value);
      } else if (copyField) {
        copyField.focus();
        copyField.select();
        if (!document.execCommand('copy')) throw new Error('copy_not_supported');
      }
      copyButton.textContent = 'Скопировано';
      window.setTimeout(() => {
        copyButton.textContent = 'Скопировать результат';
      }, 2_500);
    } catch {
      copyField?.focus();
      copyField?.select();
      copyButton.textContent = 'Строка выделена';
    }
  });

  runButton?.addEventListener('click', async () => {
    if (!root || !runButton || coolingDown) return;
    const authRuntime = document.querySelector<HTMLElement>('[data-static-site-auth-runtime]');
    const supabaseUrl = String(root.dataset.supabaseUrl || authRuntime?.dataset.supabaseUrl || '').replace(/\/+$/u, '');
    const relayUrl = String(root.dataset.supabaseRelayUrl || authRuntime?.dataset.supabaseRelayUrl || '').replace(/\/+$/u, '');
    const publishableKey = String(root.dataset.supabaseKey || authRuntime?.dataset.supabaseKey || '');
    const probeId = diagnosticId();
    const authHeaders = publishableKey
      ? {
          apikey: publishableKey,
          Authorization: `Bearer ${publishableKey}`,
          'X-Client-Info': `kenigevents-diagnostic/${probeId}`,
        }
      : undefined;

    resetResults();
    runButton.disabled = true;
    runButton.setAttribute('aria-busy', 'true');
    runButton.textContent = 'Проверяем…';
    if (status) status.textContent = 'Проверяем основные функции, прямой путь, резерв через Yandex и служебный канал…';
    if (resultsRoot) resultsRoot.hidden = false;
    if (receiptRoot) receiptRoot.hidden = true;

    const dataPath = '/rest/v1/personalization_event_reaction_counter?select=event_id&limit=1';
    const transport = supabaseUrl && publishableKey
      ? createResilientSupabaseTransport({
          directUrl: supabaseUrl,
          relayUrl,
          publishableKey,
          probeTimeoutMs: 3_500,
          safeRequestTimeoutMs: 3_500,
          cacheTtlMs: 30_000,
        })
      : null;

    const directAuthPromise = runConnectivityProbe({
      id: 'direct-auth',
      label: 'Supabase напрямую — вход',
      url: supabaseUrl ? `${supabaseUrl}/auth/v1/health` : '',
      headers: authHeaders,
      routeHint: 'direct',
    }, { attempts: 1, timeoutMs: 5_000 });
    const directDataPromise = runConnectivityProbe({
      id: 'direct-data',
      label: 'Supabase напрямую — данные',
      url: supabaseUrl ? `${supabaseUrl}${dataPath}` : '',
      headers: authHeaders,
      routeHint: 'direct',
    }, { attempts: 1, timeoutMs: 5_000 });
    const relayAuthPromise = runConnectivityProbe({
      id: 'relay-auth',
      label: 'Резерв через Yandex — вход',
      url: relayUrl ? `${relayUrl}/auth/v1/health` : '',
      headers: authHeaders,
      routeHint: 'relay',
    }, { attempts: 1, timeoutMs: 5_000 });
    const relayDataPromise = runConnectivityProbe({
      id: 'relay-data',
      label: 'Резерв через Yandex — данные',
      url: relayUrl ? `${relayUrl}${dataPath}` : '',
      headers: authHeaders,
      routeHint: 'relay',
    }, { attempts: 1, timeoutMs: 5_000 });
    const controlPromise = runConnectivityProbe({
      id: 'ydb-control',
      label: 'Служебный канал YDB',
      url: root.dataset.ydbControlUrl
        ? `${root.dataset.ydbControlUrl}?probe=${encodeURIComponent(probeId)}`
        : '',
    }, { attempts: 1, timeoutMs: 5_000 });

    for (const promise of [directAuthPromise, directDataPromise, relayAuthPromise, relayDataPromise, controlPromise]) {
      promise.then(renderResult);
    }

    const authSelectionPromise = transport
      ? transport.selectRoute(true, 'auth')
      : Promise.resolve(null);
    const dataSelectionPromise = transport
      ? transport.selectRoute(true, 'data')
      : Promise.resolve(null);
    const frameworkAuthPromise = authSelectionPromise.then(() => runConnectivityProbe({
      id: 'framework-auth',
      label: 'Вход в аккаунт',
      url: supabaseUrl ? `${supabaseUrl}/auth/v1/health` : '',
      headers: authHeaders,
    }, {
      attempts: 1,
      timeoutMs: 8_000,
      fetchImpl: transport?.fetch,
    })).then((result) => {
      renderResult(result);
      return result;
    });
    const frameworkDataPromise = dataSelectionPromise.then(() => runConnectivityProbe({
      id: 'framework-data',
      label: 'Данные и персонализация',
      url: supabaseUrl ? `${supabaseUrl}${dataPath}` : '',
      headers: authHeaders,
    }, {
      attempts: 1,
      timeoutMs: 8_000,
      fetchImpl: transport?.fetch,
    })).then((result) => {
      renderResult(result);
      return result;
    });

    const [
      directAuth,
      directData,
      relayAuth,
      relayData,
      control,
      authSelection,
      dataSelection,
      frameworkAuth,
      frameworkData,
    ] = await Promise.all([
      directAuthPromise,
      directDataPromise,
      relayAuthPromise,
      relayDataPromise,
      controlPromise,
      authSelectionPromise,
      dataSelectionPromise,
      frameworkAuthPromise,
      frameworkDataPromise,
    ]);

    const measured = [directAuth, directData, relayAuth, relayData, frameworkAuth, frameworkData, control];
    for (const result of measured) renderResult(result);

    const connection = (navigator as Navigator & {
      connection?: { effectiveType?: string };
    }).connection;
    const checkedAt = new Date();
    const standalone = window.matchMedia('(display-mode: standalone)').matches;
    const serviceWorkerActive = Boolean(navigator.serviceWorker?.controller);
    const failed = measured.filter((result) => result.state !== 'ok').length;
    const diagnosis = diagnoseConnectivity(measured, {
      online: navigator.onLine,
      authRoute: frameworkAuth.route || authSelection?.route || null,
      dataRoute: frameworkData.route || dataSelection?.route || null,
    });

    if (status) {
      status.textContent = diagnosis.severity === 'ok'
        ? 'Проверка завершена: все проверяемые каналы доступны.'
        : diagnosis.severity === 'degraded'
          ? 'Проверка завершена: основные функции доступны, часть каналов работает с ограничениями.'
          : 'Проверка завершена: основное соединение требует внимания.';
    }
    if (verdictBox) verdictBox.dataset.severity = diagnosis.severity;
    if (summary) summary.textContent = diagnosis.headline;
    if (detail) detail.textContent = diagnosis.detail;
    if (routeSummary) routeSummary.textContent = diagnosis.routeSummary;
    if (guidance) guidance.textContent = diagnosis.guidance;
    if (receiptCode) receiptCode.textContent = diagnosis.code;
    if (receiptId) receiptId.textContent = probeId;
    if (receiptFailed) receiptFailed.textContent = `${failed} из ${measured.length}`;
    if (receiptWhen) {
      receiptWhen.textContent = checkedAt.toLocaleString('ru-RU', {
        day: 'numeric',
        month: 'short',
        hour: '2-digit',
        minute: '2-digit',
      });
    }
    if (receiptNetwork) {
      const mode = standalone ? 'приложение' : 'браузер';
      const network = {
        'slow-2g': 'очень медленное соединение',
        '2g': 'медленное соединение',
        '3g': 'среднее соединение',
        '4g': 'быстрое соединение',
      }[String(connection?.effectiveType || '')] || 'скорость не определена';
      const pwa = serviceWorkerActive ? ' · PWA-контроллер активен' : '';
      receiptNetwork.textContent = `${mode} · ${network}${pwa}`;
    }
    if (copyField) {
      copyField.value = makeCompactConnectivityReceipt(measured, {
        probeId,
        checkedAt: checkedAt.toISOString(),
        diagnosis,
        mode: standalone ? 'APP' : 'WEB',
        effectiveType: connection?.effectiveType,
        serviceWorkerActive,
        online: navigator.onLine,
      });
    }
    if (receiptRoot) receiptRoot.hidden = false;
    runButton.removeAttribute('aria-busy');
    setCooldown();
  });
</script>

<style>
  .connectivity,
  .connectivity * {
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }
  .connectivity {
    min-height: 100dvh;
    display: grid;
    place-items: start center;
    padding: max(.7rem, env(safe-area-inset-top)) .75rem max(6rem, calc(env(safe-area-inset-bottom) + 4.5rem));
    color: #33261e;
    font-family: var(--ke-font-sans, system-ui, sans-serif);
  }
  .connectivity__card {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 560px;
    min-width: 0;
    display: grid;
    gap: .8rem;
    padding: clamp(1rem, 4vw, 1.5rem);
    border: 1px solid #e3d2bd;
    border-radius: 1.35rem;
    background: #fffdf8;
    box-shadow: 0 16px 40px rgb(69 42 25 / 12%);
  }
  .connectivity__eyebrow {
    margin: 0;
    color: #9e3f20;
    font-size: .78rem;
    font-weight: 900;
    letter-spacing: .12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  h1 { margin: 0; font-size: clamp(2rem, 8vw, 3rem); line-height: .98; letter-spacing: -.045em; }
  .connectivity__lead,
  .connectivity__status,
  .connectivity__scope { margin: 0; line-height: 1.5; }
  .connectivity__scope {
    padding: .7rem .8rem;
    border: 1px solid #ead8c5;
    border-radius: .85rem;
    color: #69594d;
    background: #f8f0e6;
    font-size: .85rem;
  }
  .connectivity__run {
    width: 100%;
    min-width: 0;
    min-height: 3.15rem;
    border: 0;
    border-radius: 999px;
    padding: .8rem 1.25rem;
    color: #fff;
    background: #a74523;
    box-shadow: 0 10px 26px rgb(167 69 35 / 24%);
    font: inherit;
    font-weight: 850;
    white-space: normal;
    cursor: pointer;
  }
  .connectivity__run:disabled { cursor: wait; opacity: .72; }
  .connectivity__status { min-height: 1.4em; color: #75675d; font-size: .9rem; }
  .connectivity__results { display: grid; gap: 1rem; }
  .connectivity__group { display: grid; gap: .5rem; }
  .connectivity__group-heading { display: grid; gap: .2rem; }
  .connectivity__group-heading h2 { margin: 0; font-size: 1.05rem; }
  .connectivity__group-heading p { margin: 0; color: #75675d; font-size: .78rem; line-height: 1.4; }
  .connectivity__result-grid { display: grid; gap: .45rem; }
  .connectivity__result {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) auto;
    gap: .12rem .8rem;
    align-items: center;
    padding: .72rem .8rem;
    border: 1px solid transparent;
    border-radius: .9rem;
    background: #f5eee5;
  }
  .connectivity__result > div { min-width: 0; }
  .connectivity__result h3 { margin: 0; font-size: .94rem; line-height: 1.2; }
  .connectivity__result p { margin: .16rem 0 0; color: #75675d; font-size: .72rem; line-height: 1.35; }
  .connectivity__result strong { color: #66564b; text-align: right; }
  .connectivity__result span { grid-column: 2; color: #75675d; font-size: .72rem; text-align: right; }
  .connectivity__result[data-state="ok"] { border-color: #cbe3d6; background: #f0f8f3; }
  .connectivity__result[data-state="ok"] strong { color: #1f744e; }
  .connectivity__result:is([data-state="network_error"], [data-state="timeout"], [data-state="http_error"]) {
    border-color: #efd0c8;
    background: #fbefeb;
  }
  .connectivity__result:is([data-state="network_error"], [data-state="timeout"], [data-state="http_error"]) strong { color: #b02c2c; }
  .connectivity__receipt { display: grid; gap: .65rem; padding-top: .15rem; }
  .connectivity__verdict {
    display: grid;
    gap: .38rem;
    padding: .85rem .9rem;
    border: 1px solid #e0c8b0;
    border-radius: 1rem;
    background: #f8efe5;
  }
  .connectivity__verdict[data-severity="ok"] { border-color: #b7dcc8; background: #edf7f1; }
  .connectivity__verdict[data-severity="degraded"] { border-color: #e7c88a; background: #fff6df; }
  .connectivity__verdict[data-severity="blocked"] { border-color: #efc3bb; background: #fcebe7; }
  .connectivity__verdict p { margin: 0; line-height: 1.4; }
  .connectivity__verdict-title { font-weight: 900; }
  .connectivity__guidance { color: #5f4d41; font-size: .86rem; }
  .connectivity__receipt dl { display: grid; gap: .28rem; margin: 0; }
